# Static assets (docs/compiler/server.md §13, docs/compiler/codegen.md §19).
# The harness marks a file immutable when its name has an 8-hex-digit hash
# segment.

### a hashed script is served with immutable caching
GET /assets/app.3f2a1b9c.js
>>> 200
content-type: text/javascript; charset=utf-8
cache-control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
x-content-type-options: nosniff
!x-from-app
= console.log("hashed client chunk");

### a hashed stylesheet is text/css
GET /assets/app.5a6b7c8d.css
>>> 200
content-type: text/css; charset=utf-8
cache-control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
= .k-a{color:red}

### a source map is JSON and hashed like its chunk
GET /assets/app.3f2a1b9c.js.map
>>> 200
content-type: application/json
cache-control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

### an unhashed file must be revalidated
GET /assets/index.html
>>> 200
content-type: text/html; charset=utf-8
cache-control: no-cache

### an unknown extension is served as octet-stream, never sniffed
GET /assets/robots.txt
>>> 200
content-type: application/octet-stream
x-content-type-options: nosniff
cache-control: no-cache

### HEAD of an asset has its headers and no body
HEAD /assets/app.5a6b7c8d.css
>>> 200
content-type: text/css; charset=utf-8
cache-control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
=

### a query string doesn't change which asset is served
GET /assets/app.3f2a1b9c.js?v=2
>>> 200
cache-control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
= console.log("hashed client chunk");

### an unknown asset reaches the app
GET /assets/app.00000000.js
>>> 404
x-from-app: 1

### asset names are case-sensitive
GET /assets/APP.3F2A1B9C.JS
>>> 404
x-from-app: 1

### a dot segment never escapes the asset directory
GET /assets/../server.js
>>> 404
!~ import

### an encoded dot segment never escapes it either
GET /assets/%2e%2e/server.js
>>> 404
!~ import

### a POST to an asset path is not a static request
POST /assets/app.3f2a1b9c.js

x
>>> 404
x-from-app: 1

### assets are only under their exact paths
GET /app.3f2a1b9c.js
>>> 404
x-from-app: 1

### the asset directory itself is not a listing
GET /assets/
>>> 404
x-from-app: 1
